Package: idfetcher
Type: Package
Title: Retrieve PMID and PMCID Identifiers for Zotero Articles
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "IDFetcher",
        "Blake Buchalter",
        email = "buchalter@uab.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Retrieves PMID and PMCID identifiers for journal articles stored
    in a Zotero library using the Zotero Web API and NCBI services 
    to match NIH submission requirements.
    Identifiers are written to Zotero's PMID and PMCID
    fields.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
